  "description": "A single-kettlebell chipper: 21 Turkish get-ups per arm bracketing 50 swings, 21 single-arm overhead squats each side and two more sets of 50 swings, with a 70/53 lb bell. Honours Los Angeles County firefighter Arnaldo \"Arnie\" Quinones, killed in the 2009 Station Fire. Use a lighter bell for the get-ups and overhead squats than for the swings if you must.",
